      "text": {
        "title": "Have you finished?",
        "en": "Dilnoza: Hi, Bekzod. Have you finished your homework?\nBekzod: Yes, I have. I have just finished it.\nDilnoza: Have you washed the plates?\nBekzod: No, I haven't washed them yet.\nDilnoza: And the cat? Has Tom eaten?\nBekzod: Yes, he has already eaten. Mum has given him some fish.\nDilnoza: Good. Have you ever cooked dinner?\nBekzod: No, never! But I have made tea."
      },
